{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2023-03-07 11:00:00', 'title': 'UNION PACIFIC SHOWCASES DE&I LEADERSHIP: PAY EQUITY, MAJORITY-DIVERSE BOARD', 'text': "BOARD DIVERSITY, EQUAL PAY, AWARDS AMPLIFY UNION PACIFIC'S COMMITMENT TO DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION IN NEW WE ARE ONE REPORT OMAHA, NEB. , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNION PACIFIC RAILROAD TODAY ANNOUNCED IT RECEIVED THIRD-PARTY VALIDATION OF PAY EQUITY FOR WOMEN AND PEOPLE OF COLOR AND THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS IS NOW MAJORITY-DIVERSE – STEPS UNDERSCORING THE RAILROAD'S COMMITMENT AS AN INDUSTRY LEADER IN DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION (DE&I)."}